Norm is near boundlessly curious, and love to push not knowledge, but understanding and wisdom.

Over the years he has tried, learned, done, a plethora of activities, some just long enough to understand how to touch them, but some to the point of gaining a solid mastery of craft. With Norm, there's always something new that he's wanting to chase and explore.


